WEBVTT

00:00.130 --> 00:10.075
Edit an Orkflow in the editor. Ctrl Space suggests keys and values.

00:10.075 --> 00:23.450
The engine checks the document as you type. A problem is underlined; fix it to create a version.

00:23.450 --> 00:28.175
The panel beside the code shows the keys of the activity the cursor is in.

00:28.175 --> 00:48.923
Create version stores an immutable version and its digest. A plan shows which tasks would run.

00:48.923 --> 00:57.367
Submit a run, and watch the graph fill in as each task starts and ends.
